<h2>Help & Support</h2>

<p>Welcome to the Ocean View Resort Help Center! Here’s how you can use the system:</p>

<h3>Adding Reservations</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Go to <strong>Add Reservation</strong> from the dashboard.</li>
    <li>Fill in all required details including email.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Submit</strong> to save the reservation.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Editing Reservations</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Go to <strong>View Reservations</strong>.</li>
    <li>Click <strong>Edit</strong> on the reservation you want to update.</li>
    <li>Modify the details and click <strong>Update</strong>.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Deleting Reservations</h3>
<ul>
    <li>In <strong>View Reservations</strong>, click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li>
    <li>Confirm the deletion when prompted.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Generating PDF Bills</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Click <strong>Download PDF</strong> in the reservation list.</li>
    <li>The invoice includes guest details, email, room info, and total cost.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Email Reports</h3>
<ul>
    <li>From the dashboard, click <strong>Send Monthly PDF Report</strong> to email invoices to all guests.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Contact Support</h3>
<p>If you face any issues, email us at: <strong>support@oceanview.lk</strong></p>

